  "title": "Michele M NDE 6378",
  "date": "'Oct 21, 1971'",
  "content": "I was skipping Study Hall and was going to a friend’s house, so I left the building out a back door that had a long 'drive-way’ to the parking lot. I then ‘heard’: ‘Run, Marilyn is going to have her baby’, so I ran down the long driveway. At the bottom I stopped and looked to my left, no cars then went to the yellow-line. Looked to my right, no cars, I proceeded to the curb, where I felt a hit to my hip. I think I opened my eyes, and there I saw a Yellow hourglass figure that came around me, and I closed my eyes. When I opened them again, I saw nothing but clouds and the bluest of blue skies, I asked (maybe telepathically), ‘am I in Heaven’. I didn't see anyone. I don't know how soon after I said that, I heard ‘Michele’ But I didn't know what a ‘Michele’ was, I couldn't rationalize nor did I try, I was in such a peaceful state of mind. After that, I heard screaming, and I thought telepathically, ‘Who is that screaming?’ Then I opened my eyes and I was back in my body surrounded by traffic that authorities had stopped, and my foster mother (currently deceased) asking me, ‘What happened?’ The medical personnel diagnosed my ankle, and took me to the hospital.",
